{
  "name": "personal-cloud-drive",
  "version": "1.3.16",
  "changelog": [
    "全面优化 AI 对话抽屉三模式（全库问答 / 文件夹对话 / 单文件对话）交互排版（浅色与深色全同步，原对话框与气泡配色 100% 保留）：顶部收敛为单行清爽栏与无框轻图标按钮、文件夹/单文件模式配备贴顶单行上下文条（同步折角文档图标与进入/预览/下载快捷操作）、空态升级为居中现代引导卡片、底部升级为双层输入卡片（内置思考/联网开关与动态亮起发送键）"
  ],
  "private": true,
  "description": "DPSir 个人私有智云盘 (Personal Cloud Drive) - 核心服务与依赖配置",
  "main": "server.js",
  "scripts": {
    "start": "node server.js",
    "start:watchdog": "node scripts/server-watchdog.js",
    "test:smoke": "node tests/smoke.js",
    "test:isolation": "node tests/test_avatar_isolation.js",
    "test:security": "node tests/test_password_and_recovery.js"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "archiver": "^7.0.1",
    "compression": "^1.8.1",
    "dompurify": "^3.1.6",
    "express": "^4.19.2",
    "fast-xml-parser": "^5.9.3",
    "jszip": "^3.10.1",
    "katex": "^0.16.11",
    "mammoth": "^1.12.0",
    "marked": "^12.0.2",
    "multer": "^2.2.0",
    "pdf-parse": "^1.1.1",
    "tesseract.js": "^5.1.1",
    "xlsx": "^0.18.5"
  }
}